{
  "body": {
    "content": [
      {
        "content": [
          {
            "text": "Bánh xèo is a large, crispy turmeric crepe folded around pork, prawns, and bean sprouts. ",
            "type": "text"
          },
          {
            "text": "The name comes from the loud sizzle the ",
            "type": "text"
          },
          {
            "text": "bánh xèo batter ",
            "type": "text",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "banh-xeo-batter"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "makes when it hits the hot pan. ",
            "type": "text"
          },
          {
            "text": "This recipe serves 4 and makes about 4 large crepes.",
            "type": "text"
          }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
      },
      {
        "content": [
          {
            "text": "The pan must be very hot and well oiled before each crepe. This is what gives bánh xèo its signature lacy, crispy edge.",
            "type": "text"
          }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
      },
      {
        "content": [
          {
            "text": "What you need",
            "type": "text"
          }
        ],
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "ingredientsList",
        "attrs": {
          "defaultServings": 4,
          "items": [
            {
              "ingredientSlug": "rice-flour",
              "amount": 200,
              "unit": "g",
